~~~

\n


I am an Associate Professor at the School of Software at Beihang University. Prior to that, I was a Postdoctoral Fellow at the Department of Computer Science and Technology at Tsinghua University. I also got my Ph.D. from the Department of Computer Science and Technology at Tsinghua University. I received my bachelor's degree from the University of Electronic Science and Technology of China.

*Research Interests*: I have a broad interest in systems of artificial intelligence and machine learning, especially in their efficiency, security, and safety questions.

*Questions I’m Exploring*:
- How can AI systems adapt efficiently to the evolving computational demands of foundation models?
- How can we make privacy-preserving computation practical for foundation models on heterogeneous hardware?
- How can we make deployed foundation-model systems more secure, controllable, and auditable?

{{<b>Students<span style="color: red;">(招生)</span></b>}}: I am looking for prospective intern, master's, and PhD students interested in efficient AI/ML systems for foundation models, or in their security, privacy, and safety. Please feel free to contact me!

